    "note": "All mods are drawn in one scrolling list under the Modifiers header, in screenIndex order; CustomMod renders the name as [NAME] in its color code followed by the description, with no icon. isDailyMod (customOnly=false) mods are passed to ModHelper; the rest are applied by CustomTrial in addNonDailyMods."
  },
  "daily": {
    "note": "ModHelper.setTodaysMods picks exactly one mod from each of starterMods, genericMods and difficultyMods (skipping a mod whose classToExclude is the chosen character): the eligible list is shuffled with java.util.Random(seed / 5) and index seed % 5 is taken. DailyScreen.renderMods lists the 3 mods in that order (starter, generic, difficulty) under DailyScreen TEXT[13], each with its 64px icon; the name is colored green ('g') when AbstractDailyMod.positive is true and red ('r') when false, then ': ' + description. It does not regroup them; positive/negative is only the color.",
